      <h2 id="debugging-ignition_troubleshooting-operating-system-issues" class="group scroll-mt-20">Debugging Ignition failures<a href="#debugging-ignition_troubleshooting-operating-system-issues" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">If a machine cannot be provisioned, Ignition fails and RHCOS will boot into the emergency shell. Use the following procedure to get debugging information.</p>
      <p><strong>Procedure</strong></p>
      <ol>
      <li>
      Run the following command to show which service units failed:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ systemctl --failed"} lang="terminal" />
      </li>
      <li>
      Optional: Run the following command on an individual service unit to find out more information:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ journalctl -u <unit>.service"} lang="terminal" />
      </li>
      </ol>
